{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 1, 'quote_text': "“The more that you read, the more things you will know. The more that you learn, the more places you'll go.”", 'quote_author': 'Dr. Seuss', 'quote_tags': ['learning', 'reading', 'seuss']}
{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 2, 'quote_text': '“Of course it is happening inside your head, Harry, but why on earth should that mean that it is not real?”', 'quote_author': 'J.K. Rowling', 'quote_tags': ['dumbledore']}
{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 3, 'quote_text': '“The truth is, everyone is going to hurt you. You just got to find the ones worth suffering for.”', 'quote_author': 'Bob Marley', 'quote_tags': ['friendship']}
{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 4, 'quote_text': '“Not all of us can do great things. But we can do small things with great love.”', 'quote_author': 'Mother Teresa', 'quote_tags': ['misattributed-to-mother-teresa', 'paraphrased']}
{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 5, 'quote_text': '“To the well-organized mind, death is but the next great adventure.”', 'quote_author': 'J.K. Rowling', 'quote_tags': ['death', 'inspirational']}
{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 6, 'quote_text': "“All you need is love. But a little chocolate now and then doesn't hurt.”", 'quote_author': 'Charles M. Schulz', 'quote_tags': ['chocolate', 'food', 'humor']}
{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 7, 'quote_text': "“We read to know we're not alone.”", 'quote_author': 'William Nicholson', 'quote_tags': ['misattributed-to-c-s-lewis', 'reading']}
{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 8, 'quote_text': '“Any fool can know. The point is to understand.”', 'quote_author': 'Albert Einstein', 'quote_tags': ['knowledge', 'learning', 'understanding', 'wisdom']}
{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 9, 'quote_text': '“I have always imagined that Paradise will be a kind of library.”', 'quote_author': 'Jorge Luis Borges', 'quote_tags': ['books', 'library']}
{'page_ID': 3, 'quote_ID': 10, 'quote_text': '“It is never too late to be what you might have been.”', 'quote_author': 'George Eliot', 'quote_tags': ['inspirational']}
